The payload of `[%css]` goes through `styled-ppx.generate`: descendant and
sibling atoms first, then the plain atoms (a shorthand before a longhand),
then the other contexts by condition count.

  $ refmt --parse re --print ml input.re > input.ml

Development:

  $ ../../standalone.exe --env development --impl input.ml -o dev.ml
  $ styled-ppx.generate dev.ml
